  Cite: van Merrienboer et al. (2025), Perch 2.0: The Bittern Lesson for Bioacoustics, arXiv:2508.04665.
- BirdNET V2.4, by the K. Lisa Yang Center for Conservation Bioacoustics (Cornell Lab of Ornithology) and Chemnitz
