- BatDetect2 (UK model), by Oisin Mac Aodha, Santiago Martinez Balvanera and contributors
  (github.com/macaodha/batdetect2). CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only. Not distributed with Studio; users make the
  ONNX files from the published checkpoint with spike/batdetect2_export.py and add them. Studio's spectrogram, resampling
  and call decoding (crates/engine/src/batdetect.rs) reproduce BatDetect2's published method so its results match.
  Cite: Mac Aodha et al. (2022), Towards a General Approach for Bat Echolocation Detection and Classification,
  bioRxiv, doi:10.1101/2022.12.14.520490.

